# Copy this file to services/api/.env and fill in real values. That file is gitignored and must
# never be committed. scripts/start-api.ps1 loads it at startup; values already present in the
# environment take precedence, so this never overrides a real deployment's secret manager.

# AcoustID API key -- used by the rights gate's fingerprint check (app/acoustid/client.py).
#
# Without it, every lookup fails with "ACOUSTID_API_KEY is not set", and the gate holds every
# upload at pending_review rather than passing it. That is the CORRECT conservative behavior --
# a gate that cannot verify a fingerprint must not let audio through to a GPU -- but it means
# uploads appear to do nothing, and no track ever reaches the auto-processing pipeline.
#
# To get one (free): register an application at https://acoustid.org/new-application
#   - Requires an acoustid.org login (MusicBrainz account or an OpenID provider).
#   - "Application name" can be anything, e.g. songbox-dev. Version: 0.1. Application type: other.
#   - The value you want is the "API key" / client key shown after registering -- NOT your
#     account password and NOT a MusicBrainz token.
ACOUSTID_API_KEY=

# Single-user escape hatch for the rights gate. Default OFF.
#
# The gate holds anything it cannot positively clear -- a fingerprint that matches a commercial
# release, or a lookup it could not perform at all. That is correct for a service that accepts
# audio from strangers. On a personal install it is a dead end: a hold has no second human to
# escalate to, so every track stops at pending_review and nothing can ever be processed.
#
# Set to 1 on a personal, single-user machine to make the gate record its findings and pass
# anyway. The fingerprint lookup still runs and its real result is still written to
# fingerprint_matches, so the audit trail shows what the gate saw; only enforcement changes, and
# the stored reason says so explicitly.
#
# NEVER set this on a deployment serving more than one person. The gate is the only thing standing
# between such a deployment and processing content nobody has cleared.
SONGBOX_PERSONAL_MODE=
